{"body":"Claude Code adds a `Co-Authored-By: Claude` trailer to commits and a "Generated with Claude Code" footer to PR descriptions. Turn that off in this repo.

## Change
Add `.claude/settings.json`:

```json
{
  "includeCoAuthoredBy": false,
  "attribution": {
    "commit": "",
    "pr": ""
  }
}
```

If the repo has a PR template, add a comment telling authors not to add AI attribution. Reference: elviskahoro/oss-hq.

## Done when
A commit and a PR created by Claude Code in this repo carry no attribution lines.
